      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I will draft a migration plan that outlines the transition from the agent-based system to static, rule-based Jenkins pipelines and Python scripts. This plan will ensure that the core functionality of the pipeline remains intact while significantly reducing the compute footprint. I will also identify which parts of the current functionality can be offloaded to these simpler tools, allowing for a phased decommissioning of the agent instances. The goal is to maintain efficiency and productivity while achieving the desired cost savings.",
